      "label": "Example 1 &ndash; listing factor pairs",
      "question": "Find all the factor pairs of 18.",
      "steps": [
        "Start: 1 &times; 18",
        "Check 2: 2 &times; 9",
        "Check 3: 3 &times; 6; 4 does not divide 18 exactly, so stop"
